  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">School Feeding Research Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This research project aims to analyse the nature and performance of emergency school feeding programmes, exploring how they are currently implemented by international organisations. The research will be used to develop a structured dataset of school feeding programmes in emergencies and may lead to a working paper and policy piece on school feeding interventions in emergencies and fragile settings.</narrative>
  </description>
